context_info = ()
for d in context:
    prompt = "You are given a document about Turkish media. Extract relevant items that may help identify a Turkish TV series per the following puzzle constraints. Document:\nBEGIN_DOCUMENT\n" + d + "\nEND_DOCUMENT\n\nDo the following, but only using information present in the document (quote where possible). If the document has none of these, return an empty string.\n\n1) List any Turkish TV series (drama/comedy/comedy-drama etc.) that first aired between 1991 and 2004 inclusive. For each series found, give:\n- Title in original Turkish\n- First air year\n- Genres\n- Television channels it aired on (if given)\n- Lead actress(es) mentioned (especially the top-billed female)\n- First word of the title\n- Quotes from the doc supporting these facts\n\n2) List any theatre plays (stage productions) in which actresses mentioned in the document performed that were released between 1981 and 1989 inclusive. For each play found, give:\n- Title of the play\n- Year (must be between 1981 and 1989)\n- The actress(es) who performed in it\n- Quotes from the doc supporting these facts\n\n3) If possible, identify any pairing where the root/lemma of the theatre play's title is close in meaning to the first word of one of the series titles, and the actress who performed in the play is also a lead actress of that series. For each such potential pairing, provide:\n- Series title (original Turkish) and first air year\n- Play title and year\n- Lead actress name\n- Short explanation of semantic closeness (e.g., 'aşk' ~ 'sevgi'; 'ev' ~ 'yuva'; 'tatlı' ~ 'şekerli', 'bizim' ~ 'our', etc.)\n- Quotes from the doc that support the match\n\nOnly include information actually present in the document. Keep the output concise."
    result = llm_query(prompt)
    context_info = context_info + (result,)

compiled = "\n\n-----\n\n".join(context_info)

final_prompt = "You need to answer a puzzle using the extracted notes below. Notes from documents:\nBEGIN_NOTES\n" + compiled + "\nEND_NOTES\n\nTask:\nFind a Turkish TV series (name in original language) that satisfies ALL of the following:\n- Released before 2005 and after 1990 (i.e., first air year between 1991 and 2004 inclusive).\n- One of its genres is comedy (it can be comedy-drama, sitcom, sketch comedy, etc., as long as comedy is among the genres).\n- The series was shown on two different television channels (at different times is fine).\n- Its lead actress performed in a theatre play released after 1980 and before 1990 (i.e., between 1981 and 1989 inclusive).\n- The root word (lemma) of the theatre play's title and the first word of the TV series' title are close in meaning.\n\nInstructions:\n- Use the notes above and prefer candidates with explicit quotes supporting the constraints. If multiple candidates fit, pick the one with the strongest support.\n- If the notes are incomplete, make the best-supported inference using them.\n- Return ONLY the TV series title (in original Turkish) and its first release year in the format: Title — YEAR. Do not include any other text."
final_answer = llm_query(final_prompt)
return_result(final_answer.strip())